周环绕着发光的蝴蝶，地面铺满碎石和苔藓。深色背景，低视角拍摄。\ncinematic chiaroscuro lighting style. 逆光摄影，浅紫色月亮，月光在头发和身体边缘形成梦幻的光晕，雾气蒸腾，氛围感极强，色彩浓郁，电影级摄影，超现实主义风格，极致细节，专业摄影作品影。"],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":24,"type":"UltimateSDUpscale","pos":[5279.361682551042,-1012.235031476097],"size":[210,958.9230769230769],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":20,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"图像","localized_name":"图像","name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":21},{"label":"模型","localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":33},{"label":"正面条件","localized_name":"正面条件","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":23},{"label":"负面条件","localized_name":"负面条件","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":24},{"label":"VAE","localized_name":"VAE","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":25},{"label":"放大模型","localized_name":"放大模型","name":"upscale_model","type":"UPSCALE_MODEL","link":26},{"label":"放大系数","localized_name":"放大系数","name":"upscale_by","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"upscale_by"},"link":27},{"label":"随机种","localized_name":"随机种","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":28},{"label":"步数","localized_name":"步数","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"label":"CFG","localized_name":"CFG","name":"cfg","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg"},"link":null},{"label":"采样器","localized_name":"采样器","name":"sampler_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sampler_name"},"link":null},{"label":"调度器","localized_name":"调度器","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"label":"降噪","localized_name":"降噪","name":"denoise","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"denoise"},"link":null},{"label":"模式类型","localized_name":"模式类型","name":"mode_type","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"mode_type"},"link":null},{"label":"分块宽度","localized_name":"分块宽度","name":"tile_width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"tile_width"},"link":29},{"label":"分块高度","localized_name":"分块高度","name":"tile_height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"tile_height"},"link":30},{"label":"模糊","localized_